	measure 'Show Commentary' = ```
			VAR isfiltered_region = ISFILTERED('legalentity'[Region])
			VAR isfiltered_country = ISFILTERED('legalentity'[Country])
			VAR isfiltered_le = ISFILTERED(legalentity[Legal entity name])
			
			
			VAR result = 
			    SWITCH(
			        TRUE(),
			        isfiltered_le, SELECTEDVALUE(legalentity[Legal entity name]),
			        isfiltered_country, SELECTEDVALUE('legalentity'[Country]),
			        isfiltered_region, SELECTEDVALUE('legalentity'[Region]),
			        CALCULATE(SELECTEDVALUE(commentary[Commentary]), TREATAS(VALUES('legalentity'[Group]), commentary[Level]))      
			        
			            )
			
			
			RETURN result
			```
		isHidden
		displayFolder: Show Commentary
		lineageTag: 1e5235da-fe75-4407-8942-788d638fca5e

